Pastel tiles: choose a tint that contrasts with the app icon color. Do not use more than four tints on one page. Text on tiles is always `--ink`.

### Typography

| Role | Family (free match) | Desktop size / line | Mobile size / line | Weight | Tracking |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Hero H1 | Instrument Serif | 96px / 0.95 | 48px / 1.0 | 400 | -0.025em |
| Section H2 | Instrument Serif | 64px / 1.0 | 36px / 1.05 | 400 | -0.02em |
