**Accent rule:** in every H1/H2/H3, set one word or short phrase in the same serif, italic, `--accent`. Examples from the reference: "actually use.", "home screens.", "point of view.", "building apps.". The rest of the heading stays `--ink`, roman.

### Spacing scale (px)

4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96, 128, 160. Use 8-step multiples for component gaps; 96–160 for vertical space between sections on desktop, 64–96 on mobile.

### Radius, borders, shadow

| Token | Value | Use |
