## 3. Layout system

Single long page, one centered column, sections stacked with generous vertical space. All values estimated.

| Property | Desktop (≥1024px) | Mobile (<640px) |
|---|---|---|
| Container max width | 1280px, centered | 100% |
| Side padding | 32px | 20px |
| Grid | 12 columns, 24px gap | 4 columns, 16px gap |
| Section vertical padding | 128px top and bottom (96px between closely related blocks) | 72px |
| Section header block to content | 48px | 32px |
| Heading to supporting line | 16px | 12px |
| Media panel aspect ratio | 16:9 to 4:3 | Same, full width |

**Section header pattern (repeats on every section).** A thin top row: mono label at left (`03 — SELECTED WORK`, uppercase, `--muted`, with the number in `--accent`) and a right-aligned mono meta item (year, count or status). Below it, a 1px `--line` rule. Then the serif H2 left-aligned on columns 1–7, and the supporting sentence right-aligned or below on columns 9–12, in `--muted`.

### Page order

| # | Section | Background | Content alignment |
|---|---|---|---|
| 0 | Header bar | `--paper` | Name left, availability and location mono text center, email or time right |
| 1 | Hero | `--paper` | H1 left, two CTAs under it, illustration panel full container width below |
| 2 | Apps ("Seen on real home screens") | `--paper` | Title left, cards or list below. See section 7 |
| 3 | Product showcases ("Products with a point of view") | `--paper` | One product per block, stacked; image panels alternate in size |
| 4 | Capabilities ("One product brain. Four ways to ship.") | `--navy` | Title centered or left, 2×2 bordered grid below |
| 5 | Closing CTA | `--paper` | Centered H2, one supporting line, one primary button |
| 6 | Footer | `--paper` | One row: mono links left, small copyright right |

The dark section is the only full-bleed color change on the page. Keep it to one.

