## 8. Motion and interaction

Motion cannot be read from static screenshots. The values below are recommended defaults that fit the style; verify against the live site (DevTools: search for transition, animation, AOS or GSAP) and adjust.

| Interaction | Behavior | Duration / easing |
|---|---|---|
| Scroll reveal | Section header and content fade in and rise 16px once, when 15% visible | 600ms, `cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)` |
| Stagger | Cards or rows in one group start 60ms apart, max 6 steps | Same easing |
| Hover (buttons, links, cards) | As specified in section 6 | 180ms, ease-out |
| Image panels | Inner image scales 1.03 on hover, panel clips overflow | 500ms, ease-out |
| Hero illustration | Slow ambient loop: orbit rotates, cubes float 6–10px | 12–20s, linear or ease-in-out, infinite |
| Floating nav | Slides down 16px and fades when hidden | 250ms |
| Anchor jumps | Smooth scroll, 80px offset for the header | Native `scroll-behavior: smooth` |

### Rules

- Animate only `transform` and `opacity`.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`: disable reveals, loops and parallax; keep color changes on hover.
- No scroll hijacking, no cursor effects, no auto-playing sound.

