## 10. Imagery, copy, accessibility, checklist, code

### Imagery

- Hero and section art: flat vector illustration, 3–4 colors from the palette, no gradients, no 3D, no stock photos.
- Product media: real app screenshots inside a device frame (`--r-media`, `--shadow-device`) placed on a saturated flat panel. One photo card per panel at most.
- App icons: flat, square, rounded at 22%. No drop shadow.

### Copy tone

- First person, short declarative sentences, outcome first, sentence case, no exclamation marks.
- Headline formula: `[plain phrase] [accent phrase]`. The accent phrase is 1–3 words and carries the point ("people actually use", "on real home screens").
- Supporting line: one sentence, under 20 words. Tags and meta are nouns only.

### Accessibility

- Estimated contrast: `--muted` on `--paper` about 4.8:1 (passes for body), `--accent` on `--paper` about 3:1 (large text only, 36px and up; never use it for small body text), `--navy-muted` on `--navy` about 5.6:1. Re-measure after final hex values are set.
- Meaning is never carried by color alone. Every icon button has an `aria-label`. Mono labels that are decorative get `aria-hidden`.
- Keyboard: visible focus ring, skip link as the first focusable element, logical tab order matching visual order.

### Do

- Keep one accent word per heading, one primary button per viewport, one dark section per page.
- Use hairlines and spacing to separate content.
- Keep tile tints distinct between neighbors.

### Do not

- Add shadows to cards, gradients to backgrounds, or a second accent color.
- Use bold serif, all-caps serif, or italic on whole headings.
- Use pure white or pure black as page colors.
- Copy another site's text, logo, images or illustrations. Match structure and style; write and draw your own content.

### Build checklist

- [ ] Fonts loaded (serif, sans, mono) with `font-display: swap`
- [ ] Tokens defined once (CSS variables or Tailwind config below)
- [ ] Section header component reused on every section
- [ ] Apps component with variant prop (card grid, list)
- [ ] Showcase component with wide, pair, single media modes
- [ ] Dark capabilities section is the only full-bleed color block
- [ ] Floating nav and skip chip fixed, hidden on footer
- [ ] Reduced-motion and focus states tested
- [ ] Mobile layout checked at 375px and 768px
- [ ] All hex values replaced with measured values from the reference

