```js
const io = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
  entries.forEach(e => {
    if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); }
  });
}, { threshold: 0.15 });
document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => io.observe(el));

const nav = document.querySelector('.float');
new IntersectionObserver(([e]) => nav.classList.toggle('hide', e.isIntersecting))
  .observe(document.querySelector('.foot'));
```

### Swapping to Style 1 (card grid)

Replace `.apps` and `.app` with a grid: `.apps { display: grid; gap: 16px; }`, `@media (min-width: 640px) { .apps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .app:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; } }`, `.app { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; border: 0; border-radius: var(--r-card); padding: 24px; min-height: 240px; }`, and set each `li` background to a `--tile-*` token. Add `.app:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }`.
